Privacy Policy – FinanzasQG (iOS)  
Last updated: 2026

FinanzasQG respects your privacy. This application is designed to help users manage personal finances securely.

## 1. Data We Collect
We may collect and store:
- Financial records (income, expenses, transfers)
- Categories and custom settings
- Account names (not real banking data)
- User ID via Firebase Authentication

## 2. How We Use Data
Your data is used only to:
- Display statistics and charts
- Provide budgeting and financial insights
- Improve user experience

## 3. Data Storage
All data is securely stored using Firebase services provided by Google.

## 4. Data Sharing
We do not sell or share your personal data with third parties.

## 5. Security
We implement reasonable security measures, but no system is completely secure.

## 6. User Rights
Users can delete their data at any time by uninstalling the app or clearing stored data.

## 7. Changes to This Policy
We may update this policy. Changes will be reflected within the app if necessary.

